# S-850: Pattern matching on Absent.Absent via Constructor pattern.
# [Absent.Absent]: arm fires when the scrutinee is Value::Variant{tag:"Absent.Absent"}.
# The catch-all arm [case [let v] _ v] returns the value unchanged for non-Absent inputs.
[result: [match [get? "x" []]
  [Absent.Absent]: "missing"
  [case [let v] _ v]]]
=== out
Dict({"result": String("missing")})
